*~

# Stage-8 real-dsh smoke workspace: a 32k-file dsh install plus its captured
# isolated DSH_HOMEs. The durable evidence is committed under docs/adr/stage8-raw/;
# this tree is a reproducible working area and must never enter git.
.stage8-*-smoke-*/
